Testing the model with the data reserved for training (Test Data), we got an accuracy of approximately 76%.

Inspecting the F1 score, we can see that for YES, we got 0.90, a good result since we expect to use this keyword as the primary “trigger” for our KWS project. The worst result (0.70) is for UNKNOWN, which is OK.
